{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"8361","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v11182","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"とりしも","creatorId":"vndb:s6632","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6632","name":"とりしも","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:20972","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"おかゆまさき","creatorId":"egs:creator:5243","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5243","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:5243","name":"おかゆまさき","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:20949","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"とりしも","creatorId":"vndb:s6632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6632","name":"とりしも","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:92528","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"千葉 紗子","creatorId":"vndb:s6863","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6863","name":"千葉 紗子","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:92529","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c77641","characterName":"三塚井 ドクロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c77641"},"originalCharacterName":"三塚井 ドクロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"12"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dokuro Mitsukai is a cute angelic assassin from the future brought back through time to kill Sakura Kusakabe, but instead tries to save him. Mostly, she is just like any other young girl but where other girls might shout or slap to express their displeasure, Dokuro draws her magical spiked tetsubo \"Excalibolg\" and brutally clubs her victim to death with it. She's also capable of bringing someone back to life with Excalibolg by chanting Pipiru piru piru pipiru pi (the refrain of the theme song in the opening credits). When she isn't brutally killing Sakura she teases him mercilessly, mostly using sexual innuendo."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77641"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afa04051570aef1362b7172fab49863587c1eaa1ce98318f9aeaab418299a5f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b31b35edd8eedafa69e223a05a80cf432620f19d4e20f6de6968c8ec8e768bb8.webp","width":239,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千葉 紗子","creatorId":"vndb:s6863","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6863","name":"千葉 紗子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49280","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c77642","characterName":"草壁 桜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c77642"},"originalCharacterName":"草壁 桜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"13"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sakura is a 13-year-old second-year junior high school student whose life changed the day the \"Bludgeoning Angel\" Dokuro-chan appeared. Since then his life has become one of her gory clubbings and resurrections. This has come about because some time in the future, Sakura is apparently destined to create a technology that stops girls from aging after they reach the age of twelve years. Dokuro, an angel assassin, is sent back in time to prevent this by killing him. She fails to do so because she falls in love with him. Sakura's life is still in danger because a second angel assassin has been sent back in time to ensure his elimination."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to having two young heart-breakingly beautiful angels attracted to him, Sakura gains a reputation as a pedophile at school (though this is only because the male population are jealous of him). While not perverted by nature, Sakura finds himself in tricky situations with Dokuro and her sister, Zakuro."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sakura has a crush on his classmate and childhood friend, Shizuki Minakami, who he spends much of his time with but is too afraid to confess his feelings. Despite gradually developing feelings for Dokuro, despite the way she treats him, Sakura continues to pursue Shizuki, even going on a date with her which fails when Dokuro and Sabato intervene. He is indecisive, and he is unable to choose between Shizuki and Dokuro even towards the end of the series."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77642"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fbdd28e3a74a5ecaba0e3fd7a7fb9b1604899310bd006433b93a07efa0ad6a88.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/81d890cb43f9bbdc0f9dc0edd4d22aefd500dd9740884c5ae8bbfa208c693a42.webp","width":208,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高木 礼子","creatorId":"vndb:s11458","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11458","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11458","name":"高木 礼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49281","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c77643","characterName":"三橋檎 サバト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c77643"},"originalCharacterName":"三橋檎 サバト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"12"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sabato is another angel sent from the future to assassinate Sakura before he can create his \"Pedophile's World\". Also with super-human strength, Sabato has ram horns on her head, and is unusually polite, even when threatening to kill Sakura, addressing people with the formal \"-san\" suffix after their names as opposed to the informal \"-kun\" or \"-chan\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her weapon of choice is a deadly shock-baton called Durandal which according to Sabato can \"char blue whales in the blink of an eye.\" \"Durandal\" is most likely a reference to Durendal, the sword of Charlemagne's paladin Roland."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77643"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/effdb57b40e2af6543372ca708a2ebb8edc60ea291743ecba70b6dd0fe61e2d8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/866aa601bb9759780a691be24c6b1d2461266b576996070092186f6c02f5b133.webp","width":248,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"釘宮 理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s500","name":"釘宮 理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49279","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c77644","characterName":"水上 静希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c77644"},"originalCharacterName":"水上 静希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"12"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizuki is one of Sakura's classmates as well as his childhood friend. Much like the rest of Sakura's classmates, Shizuki is unfazed by the chaos which the angels introduce. It is noteworthy however that while Sakura's classmates think that he is a pedophile and treat him with contempt and jealousy, Shizuki believes him to be a good person and is the only character to stick by him amongst the chaos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizuki seems to have a crush on Sakura but is unable to confess her feelings to him (just like he cannot confess to her). She is a bit jealous of Dokuro because of how much attention Sakura gives her (mostly out of responsibility for her actions) but seems to care about her all the same."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77644"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbc62ee5efa0c2a8d1fe7a716f5e4da665fad7c018bab9406e9864ff566119bb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/567b0c466e52a84894c633f48fe2c178792861076180457c3d8a7edd1b4add4f.webp","width":242,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川澄 綾子","creatorId":"vndb:s16","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16","name":"川澄 綾子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49277","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c77645","characterName":"三塚井 ザクロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c77645"},"originalCharacterName":"三塚井 ザクロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"9"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zakuro is a 9 year-old angel (although she looks to be in her late teens) with a far larger bust than her older sister, Dokuro. She has the super-human powers of most angels and wears a naval officer's uniform, as well as an eyepatch on her left eye for unknown reasons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zakuro is unusually polite, addressing people with the formal \"-san\" suffix after their names rather than the informal \"-kun\" or \"-chan\". Calm and soft-spoken, she is quite proficient in battle. Her weapon is a wet towel called \"Eckilsax\" which can split into two or more for close combat, as well as stretching itself to bind opponents."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c77645"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a18399c85c4e492208f8d25dfbe5f49de6c68d95d6d526b2311ed9e8c7bb4c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7af776656247106f3b3d61b75b7b143319e4e9a35e8773bce8a9c63dc6416ee5.webp","width":230,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"渡辺 明乃","creatorId":"vndb:s499","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s499","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s499","name":"渡辺 明乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49278","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c92132","characterName":"ベノムちゃん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c92132"},"originalCharacterName":"ベノムちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Game original character."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c92132"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d96248e16b2000c1370545f84f600a0cda42d457e38130e2b75cf4ab9c60a315.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/c